<mark name="m81245--fs-id1394772--question"/><p>Kepriye nguwasani fakta panambahan mbantu kowe ngurangi wilangan?</p><break time="600ms"/>
<mark name="m81245--path-2-8-3-0"/><p>Priksa Dhewe</p><break time="600ms"/>
<mark name="m81245--eip-id1168466285113"/><p>ⓐ Sawise ngrampungake gladhen, gunakna daftar priksa iki kanggo mbiji apa kowe wis nguwasani ancas sinau bagean iki.</p><break time="600ms"/>
<mark name="m81245--eip-id1164272051986"/><p>Tabel kanggo mbiji dhewe katrampilan ngurangi. Kowe bisa milih &#x27;Yakin&#x27;, &#x27;Kanthi pitulungan sethithik&#x27;, utawa &#x27;Ora—aku durung ngerti&#x27; kanggo limang ancas sinau.</p><break time="600ms"/>
<mark name="m81245--eip-id1168466075811"/><p>ⓑ Saka daftar priksa iki, apa sing kokweruhi bab pangwasanmu ing bagean iki? Langkah apa sing bakal koktindakake supaya luwih nguwasani?</p><break time="600ms"/>
<mark name="m81245--path-3-0-0"/><p>selisih</p><break time="600ms"/>
<mark name="m81245--fs-id1602243"/><p>Selisih iku asil ngurangi rong wilangan utawa luwih.</p><break time="600ms"/>
</speak>
